<title>FRANCE: UNION MINIERE RAISES ZINC PRICE.</title>
<headline>UNION MINIERE RAISES ZINC PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Miniere SA subsidiary Union Miniere France said in a statement it had increased its indicator price for Z1 quality zinc ingots to 11,470 francs per tonne, before tax.</p>
<p>Its previous price was 10,770 francs per tonne.</p>
<p>Union Miniere said the increase was in line with market developments.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
